    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I can't *** with anyone but you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day in midsummer, when it's hot as hell and the cicadas are noisy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iona, who has lost a lot of money playing pachinko, got visited by her long-lost little sister. The reunion after ten years is not an emotional one: the eldest brother, Riku, has stabbed their father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she confronts her sisters, she begins to realise that they remind her of Riku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then she realises that she loved Riku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure love over ten years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, let's start a moral love with you in a kind world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780390/extras/00f831983aa4ba8a95156c9d9599504d.avif?t=1741945508\" width=600 height=300 /></span><strong>\u25c7Akagisawa Iona</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dNo... You never be a pachinko-holic...\u201c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A self-indulgent 25-year-old woman whose hobbies are gaming and gambling, and running something like a candy shop in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her family is so rich that she has no trouble to live, and she has a lot of free time on her hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780390/extras/7636185dac616e9877d5e3b936c179cd.avif?t=1741945508\" width=600 height=300 /></span><strong>\u25c7Aoekoji Ayana</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIona-chan, you're not good at gambling. You shouldn't do that. Definitely.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iona's little sister. She is 14 years old, although her mental age and height are higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was separated from Iona 10 years ago, but came to visit her from far because of an incident involving her brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780390/extras/19532c183ef861b38eccf426021c6236.avif?t=1741945508\" width=600 height=300 /></span><strong>\u25c7Aoekoji Mikaru</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIona-san sometimes says hard to know.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who came to visit Iona with Ayana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is understanding, but also a mysterious, and slightly father complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780390/extras/02bba9b6e801b18117044871abc0f96d.avif?t=1741945508\" width=600 height=300 /></span><strong>\u25c7Aoekoji Riku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI've thought you'll be mad definitely, Iona.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iona's elder brother, who was separated from her 10 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not related by blood as they are step-children who became siblings when their parents remarried, and their birthdays are one month apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He stabbed Iona's father and was arrested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780390/extras/eb5a38ffc9f5b3ebb933f15b2c98a64e.avif?t=1741945508\" width=600 height=300 /></span><strong>\u25c7Dr. Momo-chan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHaving both ones, that seems strong, you know?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosmetic surgeon who injected silicon only in upper body. Highly educated but a self-confessed pervert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family affair with Iona and have a good friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Otome game with heavy love overall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time: 5-6 hours for all EDs confirmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of endings: 3 + after story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still images: 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine: Light.vn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the official web site.</p>",
